                                    <h2>AKG Acoustics Drum Set Big II</h2>
                    
                    <h2 class="sub">                    7-Mic Set</h2>
                    <p>The Drum Set Big II is a 7-piece microphone set intended primarily for stage, rather than studio miking.</p><p>The kick drum mic is AKG&#8217;s venerable D112. Overheads are the latest redesign of the C1000S pencil condenser. THe snare and tom mics (4 in all) are miniature electret C518 condensers, with built-in rim clamp mounts.</p><p>The kit ships in a compact flightcase.<p>Permalink: <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/AKG-Acoustics/Drum-Set-Big-II">AKG Acoustics Drum-Set-Big-II</a></p>                    
